                              "id": "bce45e70-b4ca-4787-aaa9-48662194f9ff",
                              "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                              "args": {
                                "text": [
                                  "The listing plan\nshows the service\ndoor south, the\nguest bedroom\nnorth, and the",
                                  "kitchen east. A\nrepair crew can\ncarry tools from\nthe south door\nstraight to the",
                                  "junction along the\nservice hall. A\nproposed shortcut\ncrosses the\nbedroom. Nib",
                                  "points to the\neasement:\npermission to\nrepair pipes does\nnot grant whatever",
                                  "route is shortest.\nA tenant has asked\nthat workers stop",
                                  "treating her\ncarpet as public\ninfrastructure."
                                ],
                                "avatarId": "",
                                "minHeight": 4,
                                "maxHeight": 7,
                                "position": "bottom",
